        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho kyabazinga Yosia yaayetesa abakulembeze boonaboona aba Buyudaaya n'aba Yerusalemu, beesololeza gh'ali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaaja nabo mu isinzizo, aghalala n'abantu boonaboona ab'omu Buyudaaya, n'abo boonaboona ab'omu Yerusalemu, ni bakabona, n'abalanzi, n'abantu abandi boonaboona abakologho n'abatali bakologho. Agho nga bali kuwulira, yaasoma ebyali mu kitabo eky'endagaano ekyazuulibwa mu isinzizo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyabazinga Yosia era yaayemerera gha mpango, yaakola endagaano mu maiso ga Musengwa Katonda, nga bw'aidha okugemanga amateeka n'ebiragiro bye n'omutima gwe gwonagwona era n'omwoyo gwe gwonagwona, era atuukirizenga ebiri mu ndagaano eyo, nga bwe byaghandiikibwa mu kitabo ekyo. Abantu boonaboona baakakasa nga bwe baidha okukuumanga endagaano eyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho kyabazinga Yosia yaayeta Hilikia Omukulu wa Bakabona, ni bakabona abamwiririra, n'abaigazi b'eisinzizo, yaabalagira okufulumya mu isinzizo ebintu byonabyona ebyakozesebwanga mu kusinza omusambwa Baali n'omusambwa omukazi Ashera, ni mu kusinza ebyakira ku igulu byonabyona. Kyabazinga yaabyokera kuliya wa Yerusalemu mu nsiko, mu kiiko Kiduroni, era eivu lyabyo baalitwala e Betheli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.21.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bakyab 21:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.33.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Byom 33:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaatoolagho bakabona abaasinzanga ebisinzibwa ebitali Katonda, bakyabazinga ba Buyudaaya be baataagho okuniokezanga obubbaani mu bifo ebigulumivu eby'okusinzizaamu, ebyali mu bibuga bya Buyudaaya ni mu bifo ebyezungulwire Yerusalemu. Yaatoolagho bakabona abo abaaniokezanga obubbaani eri omusambwa Baali, n'endhuba, n'emuunienie, n'ebindi byonabyona ebiri ku igulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaatoola mu isinzizo ekifaananie ky'omusambwa omukazi Ashera, yaakitwala kuliya wa Yerusalemu eri akaiga Kiduroni, yaakyokera eyo, yaakisekulasekula kyafuuka bwa nkungu, yaamansira enkungu eyo mu kifo mwe baaziikanga abantu ababuliidho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaamenhagho ebisulo ebyali mu isinzizo eby'abasaadha abaakolanga obwamalaaya obw'omu isabo. Mu bisulo ebyo abakazi mwe baalukiranga engoye edhaakozesebwanga mu kusinza omusambwa omukazi Ashera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaatoolayo bakabona boonaboona eyo ye baali mu bibuga bya Buyudaaya. Yaayonoona ebifo byonabyona ebigulumivu eby'okusinzizaamu mu ighanga lyonalyona, okuva e Geba okutuuka e Beerisheba, bakabona mwe baaniokezanga obubbaani. Era yaazikiriza ebifo ebigulumivu eby'okusinzizaamu ebyali okumpi n'aghaingirirwa mu mulyango ogwetebwa ogwa Yoshua, eyali omukulu w'ekibuga. Omulyango ogwo gwali ku luuyi olw'omukono omugooda, ng'oli kwingira mu kibuga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye bakabona abo abaali ab'omu bifo ebigulumivu eby'okusinzizaamu, tibaabaikiriza kugheerezanga mu isinzizo lya Yerusalemu, okutoolaku okubaikiriza okulyanga ku migaati egitazimbulukusiibwa egigheereibwa bakabona banaibwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
