            "sid": "2KI 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Yosia oyo bwe yakyuka ati yaabona amagombe agali agho ku lusozi. Yaalagira bagaziikulemu amagumba, era amagumba ago yaagookera ku alutaari ng'agyonoona nga Musengwa Katonda bwe yakoba ng'abita mu mulanzi we eyalanga ebiribaagho mu kifo ekyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
