            "sid": "2KI 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu ab'omu kibuga ekyo Betheli baamukobera bati: “Ago n'amagombe g'omuntu wa Katonda eyava mu Buyudaaya, n'alanga ebintu ebyo by'okoze ku alutaari eno ey'e Betheli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
