        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyabazinga Yosia yaakoba ati: “Oyo mumuleke, ghatabaagho muntu yeenayeena agema ku magumba ge.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale ni baaleka amagumba ge, era baaleka n'amagumba g'omulanzi eyava e Samaria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosia yaatoolagho amasabo goonagoona ag'omu bifo ebigulumivu eby'okusinzizaamu agaali mu bibuga eby'e Samaria, bakyabazinga ba Isiraeli ge baali bazimbye, ni baleetera Musengwa Katonda okusungughala. Amasabo ago yaagakolaku ebyo byonabyona nga bye yakola e Betheli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaitira bakabona ab'omu bifo ebigulumivu eby'okusinzizaamu ku alutaari dhe baagheerezangaku, era alutaari edho yaadhookeraku amagumba g'abafu. Olwamala okukola atyo, yairayo e Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho kyabazinga Yosia yaalagira abantu ati: “Mukolere Musengwa Katonda waimwe Ekibinuko eky'Okwidhukiriraku Okubitizibwa, nga bwe kyaghandiikibwa mu kitabo kino eky'endagaano.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okuviira irala mu biseera abalamuzi bye baafugiramu Isiraeli okutuukira irala mu biseera bakyabazinga bye baafugiramu Isiraeli ni Buyudaaya, ghaali nga tighabangaghooku Kibinuko kya Kubitizibwa ekyaga agho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye mu mwaka ogweikumi n'omunaana (18) nga kyabazinga Yosia n'afuga, Ekibinuko ekyo eky'Okubitizibwa baakikolera Musengwa Katonda mu Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosia era yaatoolagho mu Yerusalemu ni mu Buyudaaya mwonamwona, abasamize, n'abalogo, n'emisambwa egy'omu maka, n'ebisinzibwa ebitali Katonda, era n'ebintu ebindi byonabyona ebyenhinhalwa. Yaakola ekyo, aghange okuleetera amateeka ago okukakata mu bantu, agaaghandiikibwa mu kitabo Hilikia Omukulu wa Bakabona kye yazuula mu isinzizo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu bakyabazinga boonaboona abaasookagho Yosia, tighaalighooku waire omulala eyamutuukaku mu kugheereza Musengwa Katonda n'omutima gwe gwonagwona, n'omwoyo gwe gwonagwona, n'amaani ge goonagoona, ng'ajiira ku mateeka ga Musa goonagoona. Ni mu bakyabazinga abaamwiririra mwona timwalimu yamutuukaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye era Musengwa Katonda yaaloba kulekeza busungu bwe kutumbukira ku Buyudaaya ng'oti muliro, olw'ebyo Manasse bye yakola ebyamusungughaza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda yaakoba ati: “Ndidha kubinga Buyudaaya mu maiso gange, ng'oti bwe nabinga Isiraeli. Ndidha kulekulira agho ekibuga kino Yerusalemu kye nalondamu, era ndekulire agho n'eisinzizo lye nakoba nti mwe banansinzizanga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebindi byonabyona kyabazinga Yosia bye yakola, byaghandiikibwa mu Kitabo ky'Ebyomubyanda bya Bakyabazinga ba Buyudaaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu biseera bye ng'akaali kyabazinga, kyabazinga Neko ow'e Misiri yaidha n'eigye okubeeraku kyabazinga w'e Assiria kumpi n'omwiga Eufurate. Agho kyabazinga Yosia yaaja okumulwanisa. Neko bwe yabona Yosia, yaamwitira e Megiddo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abagheereza be baamutwalira mu kigaali eky'omu lutalo nga mufu, okumutoola e Megiddo okumutwala e Yerusalemu, baamuziika mu magombe ge. Abantu ab'omu Buyudaaya baalonda mutabane we Yehoahazi, baamusiiga omuzigo okumufuula kyabazinga mu kifo kya lata we oyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoahazi yali agheza emyaka amakumi abiri n'esatu egy'obukulu ghe yafuukira kyabazinga wa Buyudaaya. Era yaafuga okumala entangama ya myezi esatu mu Yerusalemu. Inhina nga ni Hamutali, mughala wa Yeremia ow'e Libuna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoahazi yaakolanga ebibi eri Musengwa Katonda ng'oti n'ebyo byonabyona badhaadha be bye baakola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho kyabazinga Neko ow'e Misiri yaasibira Yehoahazi e Ribula mu nsi y'e Hamathi, alobe kufuga mu Yerusalemu. Yaasalira Buyudaaya omusolo gwa kilo enkumi isatu na bina (3,400) edha feeza ni kilo amakumi asatu na ina (34) edha zaabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyabazinga Neko oyo yaataagho Eliakimu mutabane wa Yosia, yaamufuula kyabazinga mu kifo kya lata we Yosia. Era yaakyusa eriina lya Eliakimu, yaamutuuma Yehoiakimu. Aye kyabazinga Neko oyo yaatwala Yehoahazi e Misiri, Yehoahazi yaafiira eyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
